      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pemberton%2C_New_Jersey"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town sits within the Pinelands National Reserve, giving it a unique ecological setting that shapes local conservation efforts.",
